    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/bootstrap.jsonld#process/Process_InitializeHarness",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Process",
      "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/processes/initialize-harness.svg",
      "description": "THE ONLY PROCESS IN BOOTSTRAP AN ACTOR STARTS. A Bootstrapping Agent that has read bootstrap's README.md is at its start event and has nowhere else to begin. Every other diagram here is reached from this one by a call activity and is never started: `discussion` determines which harness and where; `human-agent-discussion` is the one reusable way any diagram asks a person anything; `complete-initialization` makes sure every step the declarations name is done; `log-message` records what a step is doing.\n\nPRECONDITIONS are DECLARED below as bootstrap.processes:precondition elements rather than asserted here. Three of the four are kind=\"stated\": nothing in this repository can observe whether an actor understands what a role is, and a check claiming to would be a green tick over an unverified claim — so they evaluate to could-not-determine, never to satisfied. The fourth is checkable, and note what it actually checks: that README.md EXISTS, not that the Bootstrapping Agent read it. Reading is not observable from here.\n\nNO work-plan element on any activity: a work plan is harness machinery and a Bootstrapping Agent runs before the harness that carries it. isExecutable is false because the engine that runs a diagram is harness machinery too — this is data a Bootstrapping Agent reads, not a process bootstrap can drive.",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/bootstrap.jsonld#directory/processes",
      "name": "Initialize a harness",
      "requires": [
        "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/bootstrap.jsonld#process/Process_CompleteInitialization",
        "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/bootstrap.jsonld#process/Process_Discussion",
        "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/bootstrap.jsonld#process/Process_LogMessage"
      ],
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/processes/initialize-harness.bpmn",
      "summary": "THE ONLY PROCESS IN BOOTSTRAP AN ACTOR STARTS."
    },
